        "publisherName": "Microsoft Studios",
        "releaseDate": "2021-11-02T16:00:00Z",
        "shortDescription": "It’s not just the Minecraft Launcher – it’s your basecamp into all things Minecraft on PC!\r\n\r\nThis is the Minecraft Launcher for players on Windows 10 and Windows 11. Here, you can buy, download and launch all your PC Minecraft titles – while learning about exciting Minecraft News as it comes out and experiencing Launcher-only Minecraft moments.\r\n\r\nHere you can access:\r\n-\tMinecraft: Java Edition\r\n-\tMinecraft for Windows (aka “Bedrock”)\r\n-\tMinecraft Dungeons\r\n-\tMinecraft Legends\r\n-\tSpecial events like the annual Minecraft Live event\r\n\r\nNo need to pick and choose – experience all the worlds of Minecraft on PC in one Launcher. \r\n\r\nWant to play Minecraft, but have a Mac, Linux or older Windows device? Select and install the right version for your Operating System at https://aka.ms/GetLegacyLauncher\r\n\r\nTerms and exclusions apply. For play on Windows 10 and 11 devices. Not supported on Windows 10 in S mode and on ARM devices.",
